            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Calorie dei pasti"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "摂取カロリー"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "食物卡路里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Food calories are syncing, but macros aren't. In your food app's Apple Health sharing settings, turn on Protein, Carbohydrates, and Fat. (In MyFitnessPal: More → Settings → Sharing & Privacy → HealthKit Sharing.)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nahrungskalorien werden synchronisiert, Makros aber nicht. Aktiviere in den Apple Health Freigaben deiner Ernährungs-App Protein, Kohlenhydrate und Fett. (In MyFitnessPal: Mehr → Einstellungen → Teilen & Datenschutz → HealthKit-Freigabe.)"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Las calorías de los alimentos se sincronizan, pero los macros no. En los ajustes de Apple Salud de tu app de comidas, activa Proteína, Carbohidratos y Grasa. (En MyFitnessPal: Más → Ajustes → Compartir y privacidad → HealthKit.)"
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les calories alimentaires se synchronisent, mais pas les macros. Dans les réglages de partage Apple Santé de votre app de nutrition, activez Protéines, Glucides et Lipides. (Dans MyFitnessPal : Plus → Réglages → Partage et confidentialité → Partage HealthKit.)"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Le calorie dei pasti si sincronizzano, i macro no. Nelle impostazioni di condivisione Apple Salute della tua app per i pasti, attiva Proteine, Carboidrati e Grassi. (In MyFitnessPal: Altro → Impostazioni → Condivisione e privacy → Condivisione HealthKit.)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "摂取カロリーは同期されていますが、マクロが同期されていません。食事記録Appのヘルスケア共有設定で、タンパク質・炭水化物・脂質をオンにしてください。（MyFitnessPalの場合：その他 → 設定 → 共有とプライバシー → HealthKitの共有）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "食物卡路里正在同步，但宏量营养素没有。请在饮食 App 的 Apple 健康共享设置中开启蛋白质、碳水化合物和脂肪。（MyFitnessPal：更多 → 设置 → 共享与隐私 → HealthKit 共享。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Food data unavailable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ernährungsdaten nicht verfügbar"
          }
        },
